WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:06.860
I heard it was going to be Shiragami 
Youko, Shishido Shiho, and me.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.820
I heard it would be them 
plus Oka and those guys.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.910
<i>This is Shiragami's doing, isn't it?</i>

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.360
<i>That girl...</i>

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.990
<i>How many times must I tell her I'm not...</i>

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:00.010
<b>Let's Go to the
Summer Festival!</b>

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.110
Let's Go to the Summer Festival!

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:04.680
"Operation: Kuromine-kun and Aizawa-san's 
Exciting Time Alone Together" begins!

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:08.210
This should bring them right together.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:11.060
You're cooking up something weird again, huh?

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:12.410
It's not weird.

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:16.410
I owe a lot to Kuromine-kun and Aizawa-san.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.920
So I'm paying them back today.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.170
Then it can't be helped.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.420
If Shiragami Youko and the others 
aren't here, we should leave.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.950
Aizawa-san, what are you saying?!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:26.910
Wait, wait.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.190
But are you sure, Class Rep?

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:30.750
I mean...

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:34.560
Wasn't it quite a bit of work 
putting on your yukata and stuff?

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.850
Weren't you actually looking 
forward to the festival?

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.300
Nice follow-up, Kuromine-kun.

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:43.500
Although,

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.280
I'm pretty sure Shiragami's here at this shrine.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.890
Kuromine-kun's on the ball today.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.770
And knowing Shiragami, she'll be like...

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:53.860
Takoyaki!

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.990
Grilled corn!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:56.280
Candied apples!

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:58.280
And going around eating everything.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:00.290
I bet she's forgotten about us.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.530
I'm not that much of a pig!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:03.620
He's right.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:09.210
You really know Shiragami 
Youko well, don't you?

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.530
What'd you say, Class Rep?

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.290
W-Well, let's go.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.630
Let's go find Shiragami Youko.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.120
Good, they're not leaving.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.450
We should go with them, too.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:20.960
We have to watch over them.

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.030
If that's really what you want, Youko.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.270
Th-They don't seem to be around.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.080
I mean Shiragami Youko and the others.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.830
Oh, you're right.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:43.570
<b>Awkward</b>

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.610
<i>This is awkward.</i>

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.820
<i>All because of...</i>

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.450
Actually, I am...

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.790
in love with you!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.290
<i>I denied it right after it happened, but...</i>

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.290
<i>That really wasn't true, right?</i>

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:02.710
Where the heck is that Shiragami Youko?

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.730
<i>With this kind of mood going on, 
she can't be having any fun.</i>

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:09.770
C-Class Rep,

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.270
are you having fun?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.750
Festivals are, like...

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:17.080
I mean, they're... electrifying, huh?

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.800
Electrifying? Really?

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.950
I actually love festivals, you know.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.820
Wasshoi! Right?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.270
It doesn't bother me or anything,

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:28.580
so you don't have to worry about it, either.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.580
We might as well just have fun, right?

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.960
You really are an open book.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:39.690
Oh, yeah, Class Rep,

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:42.230
since we're here, want to 
buy something at the stalls?

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:44.070
Candied apples or masks or something.

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:47.300
Sure, but first we have to find 
Shiragami Youko and the others...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.430
Good job!

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.260
Yay!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.520
Wh-Why is such a young boy holding a gun?!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.200
Have you never played at a shooting gallery?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.560
Shooting gallery?!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.980
This so-called festival 
allows such dangerous games?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:04.810
I don't think it's as dangerous 
as you think it is.

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:05.860
Oh, yeah.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.890
Pops, one round.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:10.370
All right, 300 yen.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.980
I see.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.840
It's a toy gun.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:18.400
You get to keep whatever prize you shoot down.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.200
Stuff this cork into the tip of the gun.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.510
Thanks. I'll pay you back later.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.880
Don't worry about it. It's only 300 yen.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.510
Aim over there.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.140
Right.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.760
<i>Relax.</i>

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.670
<i>I'll ensure a swift, painless death.</i>

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:34.930
<i>There!</i>

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:37.940
Got it.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.240
Mission complete.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.480
Sorry. You have to knock it off the table.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.440
You can't just knock it down.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:48.510
Is it really necessary to torment it so?

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.870
That is pretty unfair, huh?

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.800
Damn you...

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:53.200
I still have ammo.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.450
Kuromine Asahi, I will ensure 
a return on your investment.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:59.960
Actually, I think you should 
aim for something else...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:02.710
It looks like it's going pretty well.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:03.960
It does.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.130
How about that one?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:14.280
What's wrong, Youko?

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.800
Your smile looks a bit gloomy.

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:19.240
Shiho, I...

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.200
I think I can't handle shrines, either.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:24.150
My chest is kind of hurting.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.760
<i>You dense, starved vampire!</i>

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.570
What are you guys doing here?

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.750
Akemi-san...

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:33.030
Wow!

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:35.120
She has huge boobs!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.500
She's nothing like Nee-chan.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.210
Want to touch?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.200
Stop it!

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.630
Seriously, boys are so...

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.090
What's up?

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.800
Kuromine-kun and Aizawa-san are gone!

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.800
We lost them.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.550
Oh, dear.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.890
Asahi's here, too?

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.240
Yeah.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:59.770
I was watching while he and 
Aizawa-san enjoyed the festival.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:01.510
What should I do?

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:05.790
O-Oh, fine. I'll help you look for them.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.760
We'll let each other know if we find them.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.940
Really, Akemi-san?

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:10.860
Well...

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.360
How could I let such an 
interesting story go unreported?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.940
Thanks, Akemi-san.

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.620
Nice try.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:22.930
That's no good, either?

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:24.880
The ring has to fall all the way down.

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.540
These places tend to have strict rules.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.530
Okay, Class Rep, let me borrow one of those.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:32.970
Sure.

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.150
Is that the one you want?

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.260
Yeah.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:43.220
Do you really mean to say you 
can scoop a fish with this?

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.480
I know, right?

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.650
There you go. Your freebie.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.530
I don't need your pity!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:52.090
We have a winner!

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:53.420
You did it, Class Rep.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.720
What did you win?

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:58.290
Here you go. Third prize, a giant plushie.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.000
What's wrong, Momo-chan?

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.470
Would you accept this?

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:17.030
My, thank you.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.200
I think she wants you to take it in exchange.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:24.850
You're sure?

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:28.520
Thanks.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.510
Lucky you. You got cotton candy.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:35.550
Candy?

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:36.820
This is food?

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.580
This really is your first time at a festival, huh?

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:41.530
Yeah.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:45.020
We didn't have such events on my planet.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.000
To tell you the truth,

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.390
you were right.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.220
I was looking forward to coming.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.280
I'm glad, then.

00:08:57.460 --> 00:09:00.970
But I guess it is pretty 
different from Earth, huh?

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.390
Yes, it is.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.730
Our sizes, cultures...

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:07.800
Quite a few things are different,

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.980
but I also think

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.580
it's not really that different.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.840
We have land, and living beings,

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.130
and everyone lives each day to its fullest.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.200
I don't think there's any difference 
between our planets in that way.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.570
Wow.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.600
Just as you call us aliens,

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.460
you are aliens to us.

00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:34.350
Yet if we can communicate with each other,

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:37.220
the rest is a matter of individuality, I believe.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.750
I think I get it, or maybe not...

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:43.970
But as long as you're having fun, I'm glad.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.280
A-Anyway, where could Shiragami Youko be?

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.110
Oh, right, Shiragami...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.940
I'm pretty sure she's here, but...

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.370
<i>This man...</i>

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:59.950
<i>How could he forget?</i>

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:03.360
<i>He doesn't need to try 
to show me a good time.</i>

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:07.780
<i>Wait, what am I thinking?</i>

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.130
<i>I don't really, well...</i>

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.340
Is something wrong, Class Rep?

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.930
No, I, uh...

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.870
Let's have ice cream.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:18.720
It's on me, to thank you for 
showing me around the festival.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:23.140
<i>Stay calm. Stay calm, Aizawa Nagisa.</i>

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:26.530
Sir, may I have two ice creams?

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:27.270
Coming up.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:28.340
There.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:31.540
Oh, on a date, huh? Looking steamy.

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:33.520
<i>A date?</i>

00:10:34.290 --> 00:10:35.230
<i>A date?</i>

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.530
<i>A date?</i>

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.400
<i>D-Damn you.</i>

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:42.260
<i>Damn you, Shiragami Youko. Where are you?</i>

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:44.130
Oh, ice cream sounds good, too.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:45.320
There she is!

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:47.750
Oh, my.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.210
Why is she running?

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.170
Shiragami Youko!

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:52.960
I have a lot of things to say to y—

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.840
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.860
<i>My hands are...</i>

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.430
There's ice cream growing 
out of Kuromine-kun!

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.840
Ice cream? What's going on?!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.980
S-Sorry, I'll...

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.760
G-Give me a second.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.150
I don't know what happened,

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:20.150
but are you okay, Class Rep?

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.040
<i>I can't. I can't take it anymore.</i>

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.750
<i>In truth, I realized it for certain that day.</i>

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.750
Class Rep, what's wrong?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.140
<i>I should admit it already.</i>

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:39.380
<i>Actually, I,</i>

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:41.760
<i>Aizawa Nagisa,</i>

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:44.200
<i>like...</i>

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.090
<i>Kuromine Asahi.</i>

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:50.480
Hey, Class Rep...

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:59.030
Hey, Class Rep, say something!

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.720
I thought you were just 
imagining things, Youko.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.680
But this might actually be...

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.040
<b>Ack!                                                         I wonder how Asahi's doing.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:38.960
Hey, Mikan.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.410
Have you seen Shiragami?

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:45.490
She's been acting weird all day, 
but I haven't had a chance to talk to her.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:51.360
Well, of course she is, after that 
scene you made yesterday.

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.540
What scene?

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:54.140
You're going to play dumb?

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:57.420
After that warm embrace with Aizawa-san?

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.420
H-How do you—

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.830
I-It wasn't like that!

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.190
I just stopped her fall.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:07.120
I wonder if your beloved 
Shiragami-san saw it that way.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.820
Should I explain it to her?

00:13:10.820 --> 00:13:15.390
No, it's not like Shiragami 
thinks anything of me, though...

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:19.640
If you have time to agonize 
over it, just go and find her!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:20.980
You're going to lose her!

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.730
Oh, you're right.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.240
I'm going, then.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.200
See you, Mikan.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:30.490
Why don't you go after him, too?

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.450
I-I don't really...

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.960
Wait, whose fault do you think 
this whole mess is, anyway?!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.210
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.160
Akari, what is this?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:49.140
It's Shiragami, Principal.

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.960
I've never seen her so 
spectacularly out of it.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:55.320
I couldn't stand to see her like 
this, so I brought her here.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:59.060
To think you'd show up 
in such a vulnerable state.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:03.480
Why don't you go get bitten by 
a vampire, you pathetic vampire?

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:07.570
<i>This is really bad.</i>

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:12.660
Were you <i>that</i> shocked to see your 
man in an embrace with the alien?

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.810
Hey, she reacted.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:18.120
"My" man?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.440
Kuromine, obviously.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.210
You're with him all the time.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:24.250
He's your man.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.460
H-He's not!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.420
It's not even like that between us!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.970
Oh, she's back to life.

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:34.040
Y-Yeah, Kuromine-kun keeps 
me company all the time,

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.840
but Kuromine-kun's nice to everyone.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.460
Anyway, it's just not like that.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.100
Listen to her nonsense!

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:45.650
No man in the world is kind to a 
woman without ulterior motives.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.180
W-Well,

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:54.210
of course Kuromine-kun has 
his Eromine-kun side, too,

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:56.160
but he's basically a gentleman.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.290
<i>He's actually just a wimp.</i>

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.720
Besides, Kuromine-kun's with Aizawa-san—

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.290
Never mind Kuromine for now.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:06.210
What about yourself?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:11.350
You declared that you'd support 
Kuromine and the alien,

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.440
then you saw them holding each other,

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.850
and it bothered you so much,
you went catatonic.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.210
Th-That's not true.

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:22.100
Oh?

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.880
I swear, it's not!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:26.200
It's, well... I don't know how to explain it, but...

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.650
Oh?

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.730
F-Forget it.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:32.240
I don't need you to understand!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.680
It's just not true, okay?!

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:35.920
Oh?

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.550
It's not. It's not. It's not true!

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:41.710
Seriously, Akane-chan...

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:46.020
<i>I know Kuromine-kun's always by my side,</i>

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.960
<i>so it might look that way, but...</i>

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:51.340
<i>I-It's really not like that...</i>

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.280
It's not like that!

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:55.820
I can't explain it, but...

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:57.380
Hey, Shiragami.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.720
K-Kuromine-kun!

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.480
There you are.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.230
You've been in a daze all day.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.410
I was worried, so I've been looking for you.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:09.960
You didn't stay at the festival yesterday, either.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.900
I didn't get a chance to talk to you, so—

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:17.920
So I just wanted to make sure 
you didn't misunderstand.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.750
There's really nothing between
me and the class rep.

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.620
What are you doing, Akane-chan?

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.360
Me, the great Principal?

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:29.680
No, I'm just the pitiful 
little man, Kuromine Asahi.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:32.550
Just so you know, Akane-chan, 
you're back to your normal appearance.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.250
Hmm?

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.590
Seriously, don't take me for a fool!

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:39.950
Do you really think you can trip 
me up with this obvious illusion?

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:42.350
Sorry, Kuromine-kun! Did you wait long?

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:43.960
Not at all.

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.480
I just got here.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.440
You little liar.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.240
Look at all these empty cans.

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:50.780
Tee-hee.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:53.150
You know,

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:55.570
I really wanted to come to this amusement park.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.530
Really? Why?

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.450
'Cause my parents had a 
really memorable date here.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.500
No way!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.330
And I don't even talk like that!

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.090
What? Sh-Shiragami, does that mean...

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.440
N-No!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.210
That's not what I meant.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:10.860
N-No!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.300
It's not like that!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.380
<b>Sunshine Street</b>

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.050
<i>It's seriously not like that.</i>

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.010
Thanks for everything today, Asahi-kun.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:24.360
Did you just call me by my first name?

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.690
No, that was just an accident.

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.940
Don't say that, Youko.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:33.040
I'm sorry! Please don't look!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.690
Asahi-kun, you jerk.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:38.120
You keep staring at Shiho's huge boobs.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.830
You like Shiho more than me, don't you?

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:41.970
Hmph.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.000
That's silly.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.090
Of course I don't.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.620
You're the only one for me, my honey.

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:49.000
Wait, did this even happen?!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:50.670
Youko.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.280
Asahi-kun.

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:56.380
No, no!

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:56.930
No!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.720
Stop it!

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.340
That's enough, Akane-chan!

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.870
Stop this, or I'll...

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:06.730
Shiragami.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.520
It's not the class rep that I like.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:15.650
It's you, Shiragami.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.240
A-Are you crazy?

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:21.520
What do you think you're saying, Akane-chan?

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:22.780
It's not like that.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.190
That's not possible!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:25.150
Oh?

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:26.840
How can you be so sure?

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:31.480
It's not that easy to determine 
how someone feels.

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:34.550
So how can you be so sure it's not possible?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.460
W-Well...

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.240
Y-You know!

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:41.000
When you get to be a master 
of relationships like me...

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:43.470
Master of relationships?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.640
Akane-chan...

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.160
Yeah?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.880
Knock it off, or I'll tell Koumoto-sensei.

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.480
Interesting. Try it.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:59.400
She's lying on the hallway floor 
right now after I tied her up.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.360
Now, then, Shiragami...

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:03.950
Wh-What, Akane-chan?

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.240
Bring it on!

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.960
Th-That's how I feel, but, um...

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:13.540
What about you?

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:17.470
G-Give me a second.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.920
I've never thought about that kind of thing.

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.700
Besides, Kuromine-kun, what about Aizawa-san?

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:24.200
Wait, no!

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.130
Look, Akane-chan, I know it's you!

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:28.360
I know it's you and not Kuromine-kun!

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:29.350
Oh?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.080
Shiragami, um...

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:35.770
Can I kiss you?

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.620
S-Stop, Kuromine-kun!

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:40.820
Don't! Not like this!

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.800
No, Aizawa-san will...

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:44.530
Wait! Akane-chan!

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.320
<i>This is so fun.</i>

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:51.040
<i>I never thought I'd get to overpower 
the snotty little vampire this much.</i>

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.350
<i>And Akari can't get in my way today.</i>

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:57.200
<i>This is total victory for me!</i>

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:02.050
Akari?

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.790
Koumoto-sensei.

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.440
I-It's not what you think, Akari!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:08.220
I was... Yeah! I was trying to cheer her up!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.400
Oh?

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:12.640
By tying me up?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:14.600
Damn you!

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:20.110
Don't you move, you rotten principal!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:23.960
Why, you... You got out of the rope by yourself?

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:27.170
I shouldn't have underestimated 
a former delinquent.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.740
This calls for...

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.160
An escape!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.870
I'll kill her!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.830
Stop!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.840
Wh-What the heck was that?

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.090
Oh, Shiragami.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.590
Seriously, Akane-chan, that's enough!

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.840
There you are.

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:44.550
Kuromine-kun?

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:45.440
Are you real?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:47.290
What do you mean, "real"?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.310
N-Nothing, never mind.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.450
A-Anyway, what's up?

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.060
Did you need something?

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:57.860
Oh... I guess, or... I mean...

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:01.100
Well, um...

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:03.570
About yesterday...

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.700
Shiragami, I...

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:09.400
You have gall coming back here, you old hag!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:12.480
No, Sensei!

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.960
That Kuromine-kun's real!

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:14.930
What?

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.580
Damn it, she got away.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.250
What? What's going on, Koumoto-sensei?

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:20.660
You...

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.770
You're not hiding your horns, are you?

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:25.930
Ow, ow, ow!

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:25.930
Kuromine-kun...

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.480
I-I'm going to go now.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:30.600
Wait, Shiragami, I haven't—

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.580
Sorry.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:34.480
I have plans with Shiho.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:35.640
So...

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:36.950
Bye.

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.060
Shiragami!

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:49.910
Kuromine Asahi...

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:25.840
<b>Aizawa Nagisa's Constellation Quiz</b>

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:24.680
We'll have a proper quiz this 
time, about constellations.

00:23:24.680 --> 00:23:25.840
That's romantic.

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.770
Deneb, Altair, and Vega form

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:29.970
the "Great Summer" what?

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.520
The Great Summer Onigiri.

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:32.300
No.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:33.960
Okay, the Great Summer Hanpen.

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:35.560
Try something other than food.

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:37.490
You really lack education, Youko.

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:40.260
The answer is the Great Summer Panties.

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:42.390
You're lacking something even more important!

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:43.240
Here's a hint.

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:45.680
It starts with "sa," followed by "n."

00:23:45.680 --> 00:23:46.320
I got it!

00:23:46.320 --> 00:23:48.400
It's the Great Summer Sandwich!

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:51.070
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Stop This Confession!"</b>

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:50.680
Sorry. I take the blame for this.
